  "baseline_metadata": {
    "title": "Unofficial AI-Integrated Stacks Project — EGA I §6.4 semantic checkpoint",
    "publication_date": "2026-08-29",
    "description": "<p>Semantic-only EGA I §6.4 integration checkpoint of the Unofficial AI-Integrated Stacks Project at commit <code>00adeb291487d04070b75bd0fd87759e3c43d3d3</code>. The checkpoint adds exact source-bound decisions, mappings, residual dispositions, validation contracts, and public documentation; it changes no root TeX or PDF bytes and creates no new errata round.</p><p>R28 remains the latest errata round. Its 25 validated PDFs are reused byte-for-byte, including the exact 19,871,203-byte PDF archive with SHA-256 <code>591BB2CBF913164055E6D0539B11BA98768CB92D07314E57A0C55C0ADF5AE48A</code>. EGA I §6.4 is closed and the incomplete EGA integration program continues at §6.5.1.</p><p>This is unofficial, independently AI-written integration work. No affiliation, upstream endorsement, official Stacks tags for local additions, complete EGA integration, or machine-formal verification is claimed.</p>",
